@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

# ==========================================
# 1. SUPABASE RLS & DB TEST
# ==========================================

### RLS-test 1: Anonym läsning av properties ska FUNGERA
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/properties?select=property_id,title
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### RLS-test 2: Anonym läsning av bookings ska ge TOM lista [] (kräver inloggning)
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/bookings?select=*
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### RLS-test 3: Anonym INSERT på properties ska NEKAS (401/403)
POST {{supabaseUrl}}/rest/v1/properties
apikey: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "5db14e43-c106-46c3-aaae-d0aed5bcc056",
  "title": "Hackat boende",
  "description": "Ska inte gå",
  "city": "Test",
  "country": "Sweden",
  "price_per_night": 100,
  "max_guests": 1,
  "kind": "cabin"
}

# ==========================================
# 2. AUTHENTICATION (G1, G2)
# ==========================================

### 2.1 Registera ny användare
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alex.test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.2 Logga in (Sparar auth-cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alex.test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.3 Hämta inloggad användare (/auth/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Content-Type: application/json

### 2.4 Logga ut
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

# ==========================================
# 3. PROPERTIES (G4-G8)
# ==========================================

### 3.1 Hämta alla boenden (stöder filtrering & sortering via query)
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties?city=Stockholm&sort_by=price_per_night&sort_order=asc

### 3.2 Hämta boenden efter kategori (kind: apartment, villa, cabin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties/kind/apartment

### 3.3 Hämta boende med specifikt ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties/a0ee6254-8c87-4318-b21a-e53b49734001

### 3.4 Hämta inloggade användarens egna boenden
GET {{baseUrl}}/properties/me

### 3.5 Skapa ett nytt boende (Kräver inloggning)
POST {{baseUrl}}/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Modern Loft in Central Stockholm",
  "description": "A wonderful loft with great view and modern amenities.",
  "city": "Stockholm",
  "country": "Sweden",
  "price_per_night": 1450,
  "max_guests": 4,
  "kind": "apartment",
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502672260266-1c1ef2d93688"
}

### 3.6 FEL: Skapa ogiltigt boende (Saknad titel, felaktigt pris -> 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "Ogiltigt boende",
  "city": "",
  "country": "Sweden",
  "price_per_night": 0,
  "max_guests": 0,
  "kind": "invalid_kind"
}

### 3.7 Uppdatera boende (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/properties/a0ee6254-8c87-4318-b21a-e53b49734001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price_per_night": 1550,
  "description": "Updated description with luxury feel."
}

### 3.8 Ta bort boende (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/properties/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003

# ==========================================
# 4. BOOKINGS (G9-G12, VG1-VG7)
# ==========================================

### 4.1 Hämta inloggade användarens egna bokningar
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/me

### 4.2 Hämta bokningar för ett specifikt boende (för ägaren)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/properties/a0ee6254-8c87-4318-b21a-e53b49734001

### 4.3 Hämta specifik bokning via ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings/booking_1

### 4.4 Skapa en giltig bokning (Startar som 'pending', räknar total_price automatiskt - VG6)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/properties/a0ee6254-8c87-4318-b21a-e53b49734001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guest_name": "Sven Svensson",
  "guest_email": "sven@example.com",
  "check_in": "2026-11-10",
  "check_out": "2026-11-13",
  "guests": 2
}

### 4.5 FEL: Ogiltiga datum (Utcheckning före incheckning -> 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/properties/a0ee6254-8c87-4318-b21a-e53b49734001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guest_name": "Fel Datum",
  "guest_email": "fel@example.com",
  "check_in": "2026-11-20",
  "check_out": "2026-11-18",
  "guests": 1
}

### 4.6 FEL: Överkrids kapacitet (Gäster > max_guests för boendet -> 400/409 Capacity Exceeded)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/properties/a0ee6254-8c87-4318-b21a-e53b49734001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guest_name": "För Många",
  "guest_email": "manga@example.com",
  "check_in": "2026-11-15",
  "check_out": "2026-11-18",
  "guests": 10
}

### 4.7 FEL: Dubbelbokning / Krock (Datum överlappar befintlig bokning -> 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/properties/a0ee6254-8c87-4318-b21a-e53b49734001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guest_name": "Krockande Gäst",
  "guest_email": "krock@example.com",
  "check_in": "2026-11-06",
  "check_out": "2026-11-09",
  "guests": 1
}

### 4.8 Uppdatera bokningsstatus (T.ex. ägaren bekräftar eller avbokar - VG4)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/properties/a0ee6254-8c87-4318-b21a-e53b49734001/booking_2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "confirmed"
}

### 4.9 Ta bort / Avboka bokning (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/bookings/properties/a0ee6254-8c87-4318-b21a-e53b49734001/booking_2